sequenceDiagram
  participant U as User
  participant V as use-voice hook
  participant O as Orchestration
  participant G as Groq route
  participant M as Messaging MCP
  participant E as ElevenLabs route
  U->>V: says check my relay inbox
  V->>O: final transcript after wake prefix strip
  O->>O: no regex family matches so phase becomes orchestrating
  O->>G: POST intent plus tool catalogue with host prefixed slugs
  G->>G: streams llama 3.3 70b and aggregates tool_call deltas by index
  G-->>O: tool_call event with read-inbox slug
  O->>M: JSON-RPC tools/call read-inbox with mcp-session-id
  M-->>O: result text says agent not registered
  O->>M: tools/call register with args built from inputSchema
  M-->>O: registered
  O->>M: tools/call read-inbox again
  M-->>O: inbox messages
  O->>O: relay widget opens and phase becomes speaking
  O->>E: POST reply text with calm preset
  E-->>U: audio mpeg plays while mic stays open for barge-in
